<title>USA: Universal denies report of layoffs.</title>
<headline>Universal denies report of layoffs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagram Co Ltd's Universal unit said Thursday that a newspaper report of planned layoffs by the entertainment company is untrue.</p>
<p>&quot;It's totally erroneous,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The New York Post reported on Thursday that Universal is planning to lay off 500 to 600 employees worldwide in the next several weeks.</p>
<p>The newspaper, citing a source close to the studio, said the layoffs could eventually total about 2,000 globally.</p>
</text>
